Why FIFO?
FIFO = First In, First Out
It provides message ordering and deduplication features.
Example:
Message 1
Message 2
Message 3
      ↓
FIFO Queue
      ↓
1 → 2 → 3

Standard SQS prioritizes very high throughput, while FIFO is used when ordering matters.
